#, no-wrap
msgid "Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your quantum information skills and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr "Ambil peperiksaan 20 soalan di laman IBM Training untuk menguji kemahiran maklumat kuantum anda dan terima lencana melalui Credly."

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam | Basics of quantum information"
msgstr "Peperiksaan | Asas maklumat kuantum"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
