# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Post-course survey {#post-course-survey}"
msgstr "Tinjauan pasca-kursus {#post-course-survey}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Congratulations on completing the \"Basics of Quantum Information\" course by IBM! Please take a moment to help us improve our course by filling out the following [quick survey](https://your.feedback.ibm.com/jfe/form/SV_9WuCWHSXP8rXo7Y). Your feedback will be used to enhance our content offering and user experience. Thank you!\n"
msgstr "Tahniah kerana telah menyelesaikan kursus \"Basics of Quantum Information\" oleh IBM! Sila luangkan sedikit masa untuk membantu kami menambah baik kursus kami dengan mengisi [tinjauan ringkas](https://your.feedback.ibm.com/jfe/form/SV_9WuCWHSXP8rXo7Y) berikut. Maklum balas anda akan digunakan untuk meningkatkan tawaran kandungan dan pengalaman pengguna kami. Terima kasih!\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test your knowledge {#test-your-knowledge}"
msgstr "Uji pengetahuan anda {#test-your-knowledge}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After completing the reading and activities in this course, click the button below to navigate to IBM&reg; Training, where you can take the badging exam for Basics of quantum information.\n"
msgstr "Setelah menamatkan bacaan dan aktiviti dalam kursus ini, klik butang di bawah untuk ke IBM&reg; Training, di mana anda boleh menduduki peperiksaan lencana untuk Asas maklumat kuantum.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The exam consists of 20 questions, and you must answer at least 16 correctly to pass. Upon receiving a passing score, your badge will automatically be sent to the email you used to register with IBM&reg; Training.\n"
msgstr "Peperiksaan terdiri daripada 20 soalan, dan anda mesti menjawab sekurang-kurangnya 16 dengan betul untuk lulus. Setelah menerima markah lulus, lencana anda akan dihantar secara automatik ke e-mel yang anda gunakan untuk mendaftar dengan IBM&reg; Training.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure you're ready to take the exam. If you don't receive a passing score in two attempts, the exam becomes temporarily locked.\n"
msgstr "Pastikan anda bersedia untuk menduduki peperiksaan. Jika anda tidak menerima markah lulus dalam dua percubaan, peperiksaan akan dikunci buat sementara waktu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notice: These exams on the IBM Training site may be temporarily unavailable in the next few days, due to maintenance.\n"
msgstr "Notis: Peperiksaan-peperiksaan di laman IBM Training ini mungkin tidak tersedia buat sementara waktu dalam beberapa hari akan datang, disebabkan penyelenggaraan.\n"

